rter topologies. Another key issue is that the inverter configuration should not have any shoot-through issues for higher reliability.</span></div></div><div class="separator Separator_root__70Ime Separator_horizontal__czVEa" style="--color:var(--blue-gray-200);--size:1px" role="separator"></div><div class="RailCard_root__rZUGY RailCard_hasDescription__MjSgf SlideshowCard_root__pD8t4 slideshow-card" aria-describedby="similarTo-card-description-2"><a class="SlideshowCardLink_root__p8KI7" data-cy="slideshow-card-link" data-testid="slideshow-card-link" href="https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/h6-transformer-less-topology-and-its-modulation-strategy-for-mitigating-cm-currents-in-pv-grid-connected-inverters/51571707"><span class="sr-only">H6 Transformer less Topology and Its Modulation Strategy for Mitigating Cm Cu...</span></a><div class="slideshow-thumbnail Thumbnail_root__qLW0K SlideshowCard_thumb__86aJk" data-testid="card-thumbnail" style="aspect-ratio: 1.5 / 1; --index: 2;"><img class="Thumbnail_thumb__UXO3a Thumbnail_blur__opK6A Thumbnail_cover__1zsIi" alt="H6 Transformer less Topology and Its Modulation Strategy for Mitigating Cm Cu..." src="https://cdn.slidesharecdn.com/ss_thumbnails/h58024651-150813053934-lva1-app6892-thumbnail.jpg?width=560&amp;fit=bounds" loading="lazy"><img class="Thumbnail_thumb__UXO3a Thumbnail_contain__K6M0d" alt="H6 Transformer less Topology and Its Modulation Strategy for Mitigating Cm Cu..." src="https://cdn.slidesharecdn.com/ss_thumbnails/h58024651-150813053934-lva1-app6892-thumbnail.jpg?width=560&amp;fit=bounds" loading="lazy"></div><div class="SlideshowCard_content__xh7kV slideshow-card-content"><span class="slideshow-title SlideshowTitle_root__2VccW RailCard_title__Tvfiv ellipsis" data-cy="slideshow-title" style="-webkit-line-clamp: 2;">H6 Transformer less Topology and Its Modulation Strategy for Mitigating Cm Cu...</span><button type="button" class="Button_root__i1yp0 Button_secondary__hHiHI Button_text__ZT_3O Button_small__sqsEx