osed converter includes the mode of operations, designing procedure and components selection of the new converter elements. This topology provides a DC output voltage to the inverter at range of about 120Vac-208 Vac. </span></div></div><div class="separator Separator_root__70Ime Separator_horizontal__czVEa" style="--color:var(--blue-gray-200);--size:1px" role="separator"></div><div class="RailCard_root__rZUGY RailCard_hasDescription__MjSgf SlideshowCard_root__pD8t4 slideshow-card" aria-describedby="similarTo-card-description-18"><a class="SlideshowCardLink_root__p8KI7" data-cy="slideshow-card-link" data-testid="slideshow-card-link" href="https://www.slideshare.net/IOSR/c0821625"><span class="sr-only">Comparison of an Isolated bidirectional Dc-Dc converter with and without a Fl...</span></a><div class="slideshow-thumbnail Thumbnail_root__qLW0K SlideshowCard_thumb__86aJk" data-testid="card-thumbnail" style="aspect-ratio: 1.5 / 1; --index: 18;"><img class="Thumbnail_thumb__UXO3a Thumbnail_blur__opK6A Thumbnail_cover__1zsIi" alt="Comparison of an Isolated bidirectional Dc-Dc converter with and without a Fl..." src="https://cdn.slidesharecdn.com/ss_thumbnails/c0821625-140508015135-phpapp01-thumbnail.jpg?width=560&amp;fit=bounds" loading="lazy"><img class="Thumbnail_thumb__UXO3a Thumbnail_contain__K6M0d" alt="Comparison of an Isolated bidirectional Dc-Dc converter with and without a Fl..." src="https://cdn.slidesharecdn.com/ss_thumbnails/c0821625-140508015135-phpapp01-thumbnail.jpg?width=560&amp;fit=bounds" loading="lazy"></div><div class="SlideshowCard_content__xh7kV slideshow-card-content"><span class="slideshow-title SlideshowTitle_root__2VccW RailCard_title__Tvfiv ellipsis" data-cy="slideshow-title" style="-webkit-line-clamp: 2;">Comparison of an Isolated bidirectional Dc-Dc converter with and without a Fl...</span><button type="button" class="Button_root__i1yp0 Button_secondary__hHiHI Button_text__ZT_3O Button_small__sqsEx Button_icon__1C4qi save-slideshow-button Sav